Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Calendar|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column${line.separator}company.default.time.zone=America/Los_Angeles|
		|testray.main.component.name|Calendar|
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|portletName|Calendar|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
		|portletName|Calendar|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Configure Default View
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	When CalendarNavigator goto Configuration
	And CalendarConfiguration select Default View
		|defaultView|Day|
	And CalendarConfiguration save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarScheduler view Selected View
		|view|Day|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Configuration
	And CalendarConfiguration select Default View
		|defaultView|Week|
	And CalendarConfiguration save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarScheduler view Selected View
		|view|Week|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Configuration
	And CalendarConfiguration select Default View
		|defaultView|Month|
	And CalendarConfiguration save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	Then CalendarScheduler view Selected View
		|view|Month|
Scenario: Configure Display Time Zone
Priority: 5
	Given CalendarNavigator goto Configuration
	When CalendarConfiguration edit Time Zone UTC
	And CalendarConfiguration save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Event
	And CalendarEvent edit Title
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
	And CalendarEvent set Dates Today
	And CalendarEvent set Times
		|endDateTime|03:00 PM|
		|startDateTime|02:00 PM|
	And CalendarEvent publish
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarScheduler select Specific Event
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
	And CalendarScheduler view Event Times Via Dialog Box
		|endDateTime|3:00pm|
		|startDateTime|2:00pm|
	And CalendarScheduler goto Details Via Dialog Box
	And CalendarEvent view Times Via Details
		|endDateTime|03:00 PM|
		|startDateTime|02:00 PM|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Edit Event
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
	And CalendarEvent view Times
		|endDateTime|03:00 PM|
		|startDateTime|02:00 PM|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Configuration
	And CalendarConfiguration enable Global Time Zone
	And CalendarConfiguration save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarScheduler select Specific Event
		|eventTitle|Calendar Event Title|
	And CalendarScheduler view Event Times Via Dialog Box
		|endDateTime|am|
		|startDateTime|am|
	And CalendarScheduler goto Details Via Dialog Box
	Then CalendarEvent view Times Via Details
		|endDateTime|AM|
		|startDateTime|AM|
