	And CalendarEvent view Via Agenda View
		|eventNumber|6|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Configuration
	And CalendarConfiguration edit Number Of Events Displayed
		|maxNumberOfEvents|5|
	And CalendarConfiguration save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto View
		|viewType|Agenda|
	And CalendarEvent view Via Agenda View
		|eventNumber|1|
	And CalendarEvent view Via Agenda View
		|eventNumber|2|
	And CalendarEvent view Via Agenda View
