		|startDateTime|09:00 PM|
Scenario: View Calendar Time Zone Defaults
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|quarantine|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CalendarConfiguration#ViewCalendarTimeZoneDefaults|
	And UserBar goto My Account
	And User edit User Display Settings Time Zone Pacific
		|displaySettingsGreeting|Welcome Test Test!|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettings configure Time Zone
		|timeZone|(UTC +08:00) China Standard Time|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add My Calendars
	And Calendar view Selected Time Zone
		|timeZone|(UTC -08:00) Pacific Standard Time|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarNavigator goto Add Current Site Calendars
	Then Calendar view Selected Time Zone
		|timeZone|(UTC +08:00) China Standard Time|
