Scenario: View Week Start Monday
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And CalendarNavigator goto Configuration
	And CalendarConfiguration select Week Starts On
		|weekStartDay|Monday|
	And CalendarConfiguration save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Calendar Page|
	And CalendarScheduler view Week Start Day Via Week View
		|weekStartDay|Mon|
	And Calendar view Week Start Day Via Month View
		|weekStartDay|Mon|
	And Calendar view Week Start Day Via Small Calendar
		|weekStartDay|Mo|
