	And Calendar view Week Start Day Via Add Event Mini Calendar
		|weekStartDay|Mo|
	And CalendarEvent goto Repeat Configuration
	And CalendarEvent select Repeat Frequency
		|frequency|Weekly|
	Then CalendarEvent view Repeat Week Start Day
		|weekStartDay|MO|
